# [free_energy] (D161) on the CPU, scenario openmm of
# Inputs/check_free_energy.py: ethanol decoupled from TIP3P (Inputs/fep).
# dH/dλ and the energies of the other states against OpenMM 8.6.1 with the
# reaction field, with it and the Lennard-Jones shifted, and with particle
# mesh Ewald, in double and mixed precision.
#
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: %python %S/Inputs/check_free_energy.py %t CPU DOUBLE mdir openmm | FileCheck %s
# RUN: rm -rf %t-mixed && mkdir -p %t-mixed
# RUN: %python %S/Inputs/check_free_energy.py %t-mixed CPU MIXED mdir openmm | FileCheck %s
#
# CHECK: RF against OpenMM: ok
# CHECK: RF_SHIFT against OpenMM: ok
# CHECK: RF_SHIFT dH/dl.vdw against OpenMM: ok
# CHECK: RF_SHIFT vdW dU against OpenMM: ok
# CHECK: PME against OpenMM: ok
# CHECK: free energy openmm passed
